<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="28288066"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1732660365"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Never Forget You"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="张韶涵"/><amll:meta key="album" value="张韶涵Angela Zhang"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="01:53.296"><div begin="00:07.739" end="03:21.484"><p begin="00:07.739" end="00:09.052" itunes:key="L151">You're gone<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你离开了</span></p><p begin="00:09.221" end="00:10.839" itunes:key="L152">I can't believe it<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我无法相信</span></p><p begin="00:10.849" end="00:13.023" itunes:key="L153">I can't believe it<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我无法相信</span></p><p begin="00:13.964" end="00:16.302" itunes:key="L154">You're everything to me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你是我的一切</span></p><p begin="00:16.312" end="00:17.812" itunes:key="L155">I still feel you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我仍然能感受到你</span></p><p begin="00:17.935" end="00:19.799" itunes:key="L156">I still feel you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我仍然能感受到你</span></p><p begin="00:20.243" end="00:28.941" itunes:key="L157">After all this time, even if I had forever<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即使我有永远，今生今世</span></p><p begin="00:28.951" end="00:32.180" itunes:key="L158">I would never get over you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你横亘在我的记忆</span></p><p begin="00:32.190" end="00:38.626" itunes:key="L159">'Cause I still feel you by my side<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因我还感觉到你在我身边</span></p><p begin="00:38.964" end="00:45.578" itunes:key="L160">And after all we've been through, still I never could say goodbye<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就算我们经历了这么多</span></p><p begin="00:45.588" end="00:52.112" itunes:key="L161">I've tried a thousand times but I can't walk away<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">试过千百遍</span></p><p begin="00:52.122" end="00:55.511" itunes:key="L162">I'll never let go<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我想我永远无法放手</span></p><p begin="00:55.741" end="00:59.017" itunes:key="L163">I'll never forget you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我想我永远忘不了你</span></p><p begin="01:00.951" end="01:04.248" itunes:key="L164">It's so hard to breathe<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">连呼吸都很困难</span></p><p begin="01:04.258" end="01:06.262" itunes:key="L165">It's hard to breathe<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">连呼吸都难</span></p><p begin="01:07.103" end="01:09.427" itunes:key="L166">Remember when the way it felt<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">还记得那时的感觉</span></p><p begin="01:09.437" end="01:11.194" itunes:key="L167">When you held me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">当你抱着我</span></p><p begin="01:11.204" end="01:12.990" itunes:key="L168">When you held me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">当你抱着我</span></p><p begin="01:13.581" end="01:22.133" itunes:key="L169">After all this time, everyday just takes forever<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这段日子都度日如年</span></p><p begin="01:22.478" end="01:25.603" itunes:key="L170">I'll never get over you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我想我永远忘不了你</span></p><p begin="01:25.613" end="01:31.990" itunes:key="L171">'Cause I still feel you by my side<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因我还感觉到你在我身边</span></p><p begin="01:32.268" end="01:38.861" itunes:key="L172">And after all we've been through, still I never could say goodbye<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就算我们经历了这么多</span></p><p begin="01:38.871" end="01:45.419" itunes:key="L173">I've tried a thousand times but I can't walk away<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">试过千百遍</span></p><p begin="01:45.612" end="01:48.785" itunes:key="L174">I'll never let go<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我想我永远无法放手</span></p><p begin="01:49.052" end="01:53.296" itunes:key="L175">I'll never forget you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我想我永远忘不了你</span></p><p begin="01:54.177" end="01:57.130" itunes:key="L176">Every moment you're gone<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你不在的每一刻</span></p><p begin="01:57.140" end="01:59.861" itunes:key="L177">Feels like a million years<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">感觉犹如几百万年</span></p><p begin="01:59.871" end="02:06.928" itunes:key="L178">The memories won't fade away, no<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那回忆不愿淡却</span></p><p begin="02:07.131" end="02:10.364" itunes:key="L179">I'm missing everything about you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我怀念你的一切</span></p><p begin="02:10.562" end="02:13.492" itunes:key="L180">I can't escape this feeling<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">逃不开这感觉</span></p><p begin="02:13.578" end="02:18.822" itunes:key="L181">My love won't change<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我的爱不会变</span></p><p begin="02:18.912" end="02:24.848" itunes:key="L182">'Cause I still feel you by my side<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因我还感觉到你在我身边</span></p><p begin="02:25.562" end="02:32.225" itunes:key="L183">And after all we've been through, still I never could say goodbye<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就算我们经历了这么多</span></p><p begin="02:32.227" end="02:38.719" itunes:key="L184">I've tried a thousand times but I can't walk away<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">试过千百遍</span></p><p begin="02:38.918" end="02:42.035" itunes:key="L185">I'll never let go<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我想我永远无法放手</span></p><p begin="02:42.337" end="02:45.743" itunes:key="L186">I'll never forget you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我想我永远忘不了你</span></p><p begin="02:45.753" end="02:51.995" itunes:key="L187">'Cause I still feel you by my side<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因我还感觉到你在我身边</span></p><p begin="02:52.310" end="02:58.858" itunes:key="L188">And after all we've been through, still I never could say goodbye<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就算我们经历了这么多</span></p><p begin="02:58.868" end="03:05.314" itunes:key="L189">I've tried a thousand times but I can't walk away<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">试过千百遍</span></p><p begin="03:05.549" end="03:08.743" itunes:key="L190">I'll never let go<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我想我永远无法放手</span></p><p begin="03:08.964" end="03:12.928" itunes:key="L191">I'll never forget you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我想我永远忘不了你</span></p><p begin="03:14.418" end="03:15.851" itunes:key="L192">You're gone<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你离开了</span></p><p begin="03:15.861" end="03:18.116" itunes:key="L193">I can't believe it<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我无法相信</span></p><p begin="03:18.126" end="03:21.484" itunes:key="L194">I can't believe it<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我无法相信</span></p></div></body></tt>